  "body": "Five brand-new standalone homes. Three or four bedrooms. Internal-access garages. Excellent school zones - and ready for their first owners.\r\n\r\nWelcome to 64 County Road, Torbay, a boutique development offering five individually designed standalone homes in a highly sought-after North Shore location.\r\n\r\nWith a choice of three and four-bedroom layouts, these homes offer something increasingly hard to find - the privacy and independence of a standalone home, without compromising on modern design, space or convenience.\r\n\r\nLot 1, featured in this listing, is a sun-filled four-bedroom, 2.5-bathroom home, offering approximately 138m² of floor area on 175m² of land. Striking oversized windows flood the home with natural light, while the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area creates an inviting space for everyday family life.\r\n\r\nUpstairs are four well-proportioned bedrooms, while downstairs you'll find easy indoor-outdoor flow, guest facilities and an internal-access single garage.\r\n\r\nFive homes. Five choices. Find the one that fits you.\r\nLot 1 - 4 bedrooms | 2.5 bathrooms | single garage | approx. 138m² floor / 175m² land\r\nLot 2 - 3 bedrooms | 2.5 bathrooms | single garage + balcony | approx. 133m² / 145m²\r\nLot 3 - 3 bedrooms | 2.5 bathrooms | single garage + balcony | approx. 133m² / 164m²\r\nLot 4 - 3 bedrooms | 2.5 bathrooms | single garage + balcony | approx. 133m² / 145m²\r\nLot 5 - 4 bedrooms | 2.5 bathrooms | single garage | approx. 141m² / 180m², privately positioned at the rear with additional parking option\r\nLots 2-4 feature their own balconies, while Lot 5 offers the largest landholding and a private rear position, giving buyers a genuine choice depending on lifestyle and budget.\r\n\r\nAnd the location completes the package. Enjoy easy access to Long Bay, local beaches, parks and shopping, while families will appreciate being in zone for Long Bay College, Northcross Intermediate and Torbay School.\r\n\r\nWhether you're buying your first home, upsizing, downsizing or looking for a low-maintenance investment, this is an opportunity to secure a brand-new standalone home in an established North Shore neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nFive homes are available now - come through, compare the options and choose your favourite.\r\n\r\nContact us TODAY to arrange a private viewing, or visit our next Open Home.",
